OL,3,CTeletext on the internet
OL,4,C
OL,5,GWebfaxFis a tribute to teletext
OL,6,Fservices such asGCeefaxFandGORACLE.
OL,7,F
OL,8,FRather than being embedded in the
OL,9,Fbroadcast signal of a TV channel,
OL,10,GWebfaxFis available on the internet.
OL,12,FBut just like the broadcast services of
OL,13,Fthe past, it offers a mix of the latest
OL,14,Fnews, sport, weather, travel, TV/radio
OL,15,Flistings and more.
OL,17,GWebfaxFis managed byGThe TV RoomFbut is
OL,18,Fonly possible through a collaboration
OL,19,Fwith some very clever people:
OL,21,CGNathan Dane      CGAlistair Cree
OL,22,CGTerence Burridge C
